OL,3,CWinter Olympics: Matt Weston secures
OL,4,Cskeleton gold and Team GB's first medal
OL,6,FMatt Weston secured Britain's first
OL,7,Fmedal at the 2026 Winter Olympics as
OL,8,Fhe scooped gold in the men's skeleton.
OL,10,FThe dual world champion had dominated
OL,11,Ffrom the beginning of the competition,
OL,12,Fsetting track records in both of his
OL,13,Ffirst two runs at the Cortina Sliding
OL,14,FCentre on Thursday.
