PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1771377250
OL,3,CWinter Olympics: Matt Weston secures
OL,4,Cskeleton gold and Team GB's first medal
OL,6,FHe started the final two heats on
OL,7,FFriday with a combined time of one
OL,8,Fminute 52.09 seconds, 0.3 seconds
OL,9,Fahead of Axel Jungk, and quickly built
OL,10,Fon that advantage when setting another
OL,11,Fnew best in clocking 55.63 seconds for
OL,12,Fhis third run.
OL,14,FThat gave him a 0.39 second advantage
OL,15,Fover Jungk going into the final heat
OL,16,Fand Weston made no mistake as he
OL,17,Fincreased his margin of victory to
OL,18,F0.88 seconds in his final run.
OL,20,FJungk was second with fellow German
OL,21,FChristopher Grotheer third.
