CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1771377250
OL,3,CWinter Olympics: Matt Weston secures
OL,4,Cskeleton gold and Team GB's first medal
OL,6,FWeston said: "(It means) everything.
OL,7,FIt means a hell of a lot to me
OL,8,Fpersonally, I have worked so hard for
OL,9,Fthis.
OL,11,F"Everyone back at home, my fiancee, my
OL,12,Ffamily, my friends, everyone that has
OL,13,Fsacrificed for me to be here. I have
OL,14,Fmissed funerals, birthdays, everything
OL,15,Ffor this moment and it feels amazing."
